window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Monica believes Jonathan despite her better judgment. Forgives him despite her doubts.</p> <p>She loves him…just because.</p> <p>Her heart isn't sensible or guarded enough. Not by a sight. She’s a walking raw nerve ending of emotion, as if the celibate years she'd spent before him made her more emotional, more vulnerable, more foolish.</p> <p>And she agreed to all of it yesterday and today.</p> <p>She’d agree to it tomorrow and forever, but for one thing.</p> <p>There might not be a tomorrow for her king.</p>"; 
